        <span data-id="pg047_n0018">Pra, vendimmarrja &#xeb;sht&#xeb; edhe proces i arritjes s&#xeb; kompromisit.</span>
        <span data-id="pg047_n0019">Por, para se t&#xeb; merren vendime, njer&#xeb;zit diskutojn&#xeb; me nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span>
        <span data-id="pg047_n0020">Nd&#xeb;rsa, diskutimi duhet t&#xeb; b&#xeb;het sipas disa rregullave.</span>
        <span data-id="pg047_n0021">Prandaj, p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;u marr&#xeb; vesh sa m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; me nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin, hartohen rregulla q&#xeb; duhen zbatuar nga t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg047_n0022">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t duhet t&#xeb; ndihen t&#xeb; pranuar, t&#xeb; respektuar, t&#xeb; mbrojtur, t&#xeb; barabart&#xeb; n&#xeb; ambientet brenda dhe jasht&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb;s.</span>
        <span data-id="pg047_n0023">P&#xeb;rfshirja n&#xeb; vendimmarrje n&#xeb;nkupton pjes&#xeb;marrjen e f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve n&#xeb; planifikim, n&#xeb; ndarjen e p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sive, n&#xeb; aktivitetet e ndryshme etj.</span>
